**Work Request Agent** helps organizations automate the creation and management of maintenance work requests in Microsoft Dynamics 365 Business Central.  
The agent interprets maintenance requests received via email, identifies the equipment involved, extracts relevant information, and automatically generates maintenance work requests within Business Central.

**Key Benefits**

- Automates maintenance request intake and processing.
- Reduces manual administration activities.
- Speeds up maintenance response times.
- Improves data quality and process consistency.
- Enhances traceability across maintenance operations.

By converting maintenance requests into structured workflows, **Work Request Agent** helps maintenance teams improve operational efficiency and focus on high-value activities.